Short-Circuit Field is one of the [[Field Effects]] present in Rejuvenation. It is classified as a Synthetic field.

==Transitions From Other Fields==
* [[Factory Field]] will transform into this field if the moves Aura Wheel, Bulldoze, Discharge, Earthquake, Explosion, Fissure, Ion Deluge, Magnitude, Overdrive, Self-Destruct, [[Super U.M.D. Move]] (Physical attack), or the the Z-Moves Gigavolt Havoc, Light That Burns the Sky, or Tectonic Rage are used.
** ''"The field shorted out!"''
** ''"The field was broken!"''
** ''"All the light was consumed!"''
*** Aura Wheel, Discharge, Gigavolt Havoc, Ion Deluge, Overdrive & Super U.M.D. Move also change Short-Circuit Field back to Factory Field, allowing to alternate between both fields.

==General Effects==

===Field Rolls===
This field has a cycling modifier that changes each time a Physical or Special Electric-type move is used.
* The current Roll is only updated after all effects caused by the move (damage, abilities...) happen.
* This modifier affects the damage of Electric-type moves and the effects of the abilities Lightning Rod, Motor Drive & Volt Absorb.
** Volt Absorb's terrain specific effects are not buffed.
* From weakest to strongest, the rolls are 3 → 1 → 4 → 2 → 5.
* If the [[Electric Terrain]] is overlayed on top of this field, the Roll will always be the 5th one.
** In this situation, the overlayed Electric Terrain's 1.3x boost to Electric-type moves is disabled.
* Changing the field prevents the Roll from changing until the Short-Circuit Field comes back, but does not reset the roll.

====1st Roll====
* Electric-type moves → 0.8x decrease.
** ''"Bzzt."''
* Volt Absorb restores 20% of the bearer's Max HP on activation instead of 25%.

====2nd Roll====
* Electric-type moves → 1.5x boost.
** ''"Bzzapp!"''
* Lightning Rod raises the bearer's Special Attack by 2 stages on activation.
* Motor Drive raises the bearer's Speed by 2 Stages on activation.
* Volt Absorb restores 37.5% of the bearer's Max HP on activation instead of 25%.

====3rd Roll====
* Electric-type moves → 0.5x decrease.
** ''"Bzt..."''
* Lightning Rod does not raise the bearer's Special Attack on activation.
* Motor Drive does not raise the bearer's Speed on activation.
* Volt Absorb restores 12.5% of the bearer's Max HP on activation instead of 25%.

====4th Roll====
* Electric-type moves → 1.2x boost.
** ''"Bzap!"''
* Volt Absorb restores 30% of the bearer's Max HP on activation instead of 25%.

====5th Roll====
* Electric-type moves → 2x boost.
** ''"BZZZAPP!"''
* Lightning Rod raises the bearer's Special Attack by 3 stages on activation.
* Motor Drive raises the bearer's Speed by 3 Stages on activation.
* Volt Absorb restores 50% of the bearer's Max HP on activation instead of 25%.

==Abilities Affected==

===Activated Abilities===

* Minus
* Plus
* Surge Surfer

===Buffed Abilities===

* [[Defragment]] raises both the user's Defense and Special Defense by 1 stage on activation.
** ''"[Pokémon] is glitching out!"''
* Download raises both the user's Attack and Special Attack by 1 stage on activation.
** ''"[Pokémon] is glitching out!"''
* Galvanize increases base power by 2x for affected moves instead of 1.2x.
* Static has a doubled chance to activate (60%).
* Volt Absorb restores 1/16 of the bearer's Max HP at the end of each turn.
** ''"[Pokémon] absorbed stray electricity!"''
*** This healing or the one caused by an [[Electric Terrain]] overlay are not buffed by the Roll modifier.

===Other Ability Changes===

* Gulp Missile will always pick up Pikachu.
* Steelworker gives the bearer's Steel-type moves an Electric sub-typing.

==Moves Affected==

===Damage Modifiers===

====Moves which receive an attack buff====

* Steel Beam → 1.667x boost, Electric sub-typing and causes the user to faint.
** As of V14.0.22, the in-game Field Notes incorrectly states that the modifier is 2x.
* Flash Cannon, Gear Grind, Gyro Ball, Magnet Bomb, Muddy Water, Surf → 1.5x boost, Electric sub-typing.
** ''"Blinding!"''
** ''"The attack picked up electricity!"''
*  Dazzling Gleam, Hydro Vortex, Lumina Crash, [[Super U.M.D. Move]] → 1.5x boost.
** ''"Blinding!"''
** ''"The attack picked up electricity!"''
** ''"CHARGING UP!"''
* Phantom Force, Shadow force → 1.3x boost, lasts 1 turn.
** ''"The darkness strengthened the attack!"''
* Dark Pulse, Night Daze, Night Slash, Shadow Ball, Shadow Bone, Shadow Claw, Shadow Force, Shadow Punch, Shadow Sneak → 1.3x boost.
** ''"The darkness strengthened the attack!"''

====Moves which receive an attack nerf====

* Light That Burns the Sky → 0.5x decrease.
** ''"[Pokémon] couldn't consume much light..."''

===Other Moves===

====Buffed Moves====

* Flash lowers the target's Accuracy by 2 stages.
* Magnet Rise lasts for 8 turns.
* Metal Sound lowers the target's Special Defense by 3 stages.
* Zap Cannon's accuracy is increased to 80%.

===Field-dependent moves & Abilities===

* Mimicry changes the bearer's type to Electric.
* Camouflage changes the user's type to Electric.
* Nature Power becomes Discharge.
* Secret Power may Paralyze.
* Shelter halves damage from Electric-type moves.
* Terrain Pulse's type becomes Electric.

==Transitions to Other Fields==

'''Any move in this section inherently gains a 1.3x damage boost on top of any other previously listed modifiers.'''

* This field will transform into [[Factory Field]] if the moves Aura Wheel, Charge Beam, Discharge, Ion Deluge, Overdrive, Parabolic Charge, [[Super U.M.D. Move]] (Special attack), Wild Charge, or the Z-Move Gigavolt Havoc are used once, of if the move Tidy Up is used twice.
** ''"SYSTEM ONLINE."''
** ''"Some junk was cleaned up!"''

==Items==

*[[Synthetic Seed]] boosts Special Defense and applies Magnet Rise to the user.
* The Dusk Ball's catch rate buff is enabled.

==Notes==

* Prior to V14, Hydro Vortex gained an Electric sub-typing on this field.

